  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0-preview.0: first-class hybrid event-sourcing + DDD. AggregateRoot.Apply is now public and advances Revision (the aggregate version); Rehydrate restores Revision/OriginalVersion; ConcurrencyConflictException + EF UseArhamOptimisticConcurrency() and Mongo ReplaceWithConcurrencyAsync() for optimistic concurrency; dormant event-schema upcaster mechanism (DomainEvent.SchemaVersion, SerializedDomainEvent, IDomainEventUpcaster, DomainEventUpcaster). Behavioral: aggregates must stop hand-incrementing Revision. See CHANGELOG.md / docs/EventSourcing.md.",
